===Etymology 2===
Two main origins:
* Borrowed from {{bor|en|vi|Thư}}, the local romanization of the {{der|en|zh|-}} surname {{m|zh|舒|tr=Shū}}.
* Borrowed from {{bor|en|no|Thu}}, a surname predominantly found in [[Western Norway]].

