=====Statistics=====
* According to the 2010 United States Census, ''Thu'' is the 39052<sup>nd</sup> most common surname in the United States, belonging to 564 individuals. ''Thu'' is most common among Asian/Pacific Islander (82.62%) and White (14.36%) individuals.

